[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_FLUTTERSHY_HARBOUR]
Investigate §YFluttershy Harbour§!

[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_FLUTTERSHY_HARBOUR_desc]
Fluttershy Habour is the only seaport in the Eastern Region and the second largest seaport of the Kirin commune. When this major smuggling case occurs, investigating Fluttershy Habour is almost the first reaction of the task force.

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_FLUTTERSHY_HARBOUR]
调查§Y柔柔港§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_FLUTTERSHY_HARBOUR_desc]
柔柔港是东部地区唯一的海港，也是麒麟社群的第二大海港，当这个重大走私案件发生时，调查柔柔港几乎是专案组的第一反应。
